# GW2 API key, needed only by the account/ tools (account.window,
# account.snapshot) and the NAV series (invest.nav).
# Make one at https://account.arena.net/applications with these scopes:
#   account, wallet, inventories, characters, tradingpost
# account.window needs just account + tradingpost; the rest are for the full
# account valuation in account.snapshot. The key is read-only and never printed.
# The price collector uses public endpoints and needs no key.
# For the daily NAV point in CI, add the same key as a repository secret.
GW2_API_KEY=

# Investable gold (whole number), the denominator for the per-strategy
# allocation caps and exposure shares on the benchmarks page. Optional;
# in CI it is a repository Actions variable, never a value in the repo.
BANKROLL_G=
